24:["$","section",null,{"className":"flex flex-col","style":{"gap":"var(--space-2)"},"children":[["$","h2",null,{"id":"$undefined","className":"$undefined","style":"$undefined","children":"Data kept on your device by What to eat"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"prose [&>*+*]:mt-[var(--space-4)] [&_h2]:mt-[var(--space-8)] [&_h3]:mt-[var(--space-6)]","style":{"maxWidth":"var(--measure-en)"},"children":["$","p",null,{"children":"The What to eat section keeps personal data only in your browser's own storage (localStorage), under names that start with trytpc.eat.v1. That is your favourites, dishes you never want suggested, what you tapped \"I'll eat this\" for with the price at that moment, your saved filters and a saved week plan. None of it is sent anywhere and there is no account. Clear it any time with the \"Clear everything\" button on Your stuff (/eat/mine), or by clearing this site's data in your browser."}]}]]}]
